# A1/A4 end-to-end shell flow for a marker-prefixed + (RomM)-tagged on-card name: the decorated
# path must flow through the save check AND into the wizard argv unmangled (launch-card-v2:
# the card is the interactive surface now).
desc fetch hook: marker+tag named rom (separate mode shape) -> decorated path reaches the wizard intact
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda (RomM).gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda (RomM).gba
engine 0|101\t2026-07-01 10:00\tBrick\t32KB\tCURRENT\nLOCAL=current
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_trace ENGINE --list-saves
expect_trace ✓ Zelda (RomM).gba => rc=0
expect_log local=current action=card
